<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2TH" style="id">- Sefwi New Testament</book>
  <para style="h">2 Tɛsalonikafoɛ</para>
  <para style="toc3">2Tɛ</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Tɛsalonikafoɛ</para>
  <para style="toc1">TƐSALONIKAFOƐ NWOMAA BƆ ƆTƆ SO NYƆ</para>
  <para style="mt1">TƐSALONIKAFOƐ</para>
  <para style="mt4">NWOMAA BƆ ƆTƆ SO NYƆ</para>
  <para style="ip">Paul hworɔle krataa bɔ oli moa mane Tɛsalonikafoɛ ne, ye afoɛ ko si wɔ afoɛ 51 Y.A<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:0 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Y.A kyire Yesu Aberɛ so (Brɔfo: </char><char style="it">Common Era</char> anaa <char style="it">C.E</char>)</note> yeɛ ɔhworɔle krataa bɔ ɔtɔ so nyɔ ne ɔ. Na ɛhene koso ɔhworɔle ye wɔ Korinto berɛ ala. Wɔ Paul krataa bɔ oli moa nanu, otuli aliemaa nemɔ fo kyɛ bɛtena berɛ konn, bɛli b'awuro dwirɛ, na bɛyɛ adwuma bɛnea bɛ nwo.</para>
  <para style="ip">Nakoso né aliemaa biemɔ tɛ́ fa bɛ nwo wuro-wura amanvoɛ dwirɛ nu, na ne bɛnguro kyɛ bɛyɛ adwuma bɛnea bɛ nwo. Ɛhene la ahameɛ a, ne aliemaa nemɔ anya ngrataa biemɔ bɔ wayɛ kyɛ ofi Paul berɛ, na ne bahworɔ ye wɔ sɔ ngrataa nanu kyɛ “Awurade kyẽa” ne awa dada (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2TH 2:1-2">2Tɛ 2:1-2</ref></char>). Yeti ne odikyɛ Paul tworɔ krataa bɔ ɔtɔ so nyɔ ne ma bɛ.</para>
  <para style="ip">Wɔ sɔ krataa he anu ne, Paul maa bɛnwuni kyɛ, kora bɔ Awurade kyẽa ne kɔwa ne, sana Awaefoɛ nemɔ ba, maa sona bɔ onni mmeraa so ne nwo da berɛ kora. Ná ɔmaa bɛnwuni kyɛ sɛ Yesu ba a, ɔkɔsɛkye Nyameɛ atamfo nemɔ, na Kristofoɛ bɔ bɛhyɛ bɛ so ne, okobu atɛn tenenee kɔma bɛ.</para>
  <para style="ipi">Sɔ Krataa he anu ngome yeɛ Paul hane “sona bɔ onni mmeraa so” ne nwo dwirɛ ɔ. —<char style="xt"><ref loc="2TH 2:3">2Tɛ 2:3</ref>, <ref loc="2TH 2:8">8</ref>, <ref loc="2TH 2:9">9</ref></char>.</para>
  <para style="ipi">• Krataa he anwa, nakoso ɔka mbaeɛ nwo dwirɛ paa. —<char style="xt"><ref loc="2TH 1:3">2Tɛ 1:3</ref>, <ref loc="2TH 1:11">11</ref>; <ref loc="2TH 2:13">2:13</ref>; <ref loc="2TH 3:1">3:1</ref>.</char></para>
  <para style="ib" />
  <para style="ip">Paul sa maa bɛnwuni suban biemɔ bɔ odikyɛ bɛtwe bɛ nwo bɛfi ye nwo. Na osa maa bɛnwuni kyɛ, bɛhwe bɛ nwo bɛfi bɛbɔ bɛnate basabasa, na bɛnguro kyɛ bɛyɛ adwuma nanwo. Nakoso, nnɛmaa bɛbu bɛ kyɛ bɛte b'atamfo, mmom bɛtu bɛ fo kyɛ aliemaa mɔ kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a, bɛkɔsakra b'adwene ɔ.—<char style="xt"><ref loc="2TH 3:10-15">2Tɛ 3:10-15</ref>.</char></para>
  <para style="ib" />
  <para style="iot">ENU DWIRƐ</para>
  <para style="io1">Ngyeaa (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2TH 1:1-2">1:1-2</ref> </char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Tɛsalonikafoɛ gyidie yɛ piri (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2TH 1:3-5">1:3-5</ref> </char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Bɛkɔhwe bɛbɔ bɛ so yɛ se ne so (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2TH 1:6-10">1:6-10</ref> </char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Mbaeɛ bɔ bɛbɔ bɛmane asafo ne (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2TH 1:11-12">1:11-12</ref> </char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Sona bɔ onni mmeraa so ne (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2TH 2:1-12">2:1-12</ref> </char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Otule bɛ fo kyɛ begyina pindinn (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2TH 2:13-17">2:13-17</ref> </char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Ɛmɔhɔ so bɛbɔ mbaeɛ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2TH 3:1-5">3:1-5</ref> </char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Bɛbɔ bɛnate basabasa ne (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2TH 3:6-15">3:6-15</ref> </char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Ngyeaa bɔ ɔpɛ yebo (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2TH 3:16-18">3:16-18</ref> </char>)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2TH 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 1:1" />Krataa he fi Paul, Silwano, ne Timoteo berɛ,</para>
  <para style="m" vid="2TH 1:1">na yɛfa yɛkɔma asafo bɔ ɔwɔ Tɛsalonika bɔ bɛne Baba Nyameɛ ne Awurade Yesu Kristo ayɛ kõ ne:<verse eid="2TH 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 1:2" />Adom ne asomdwie bɔ ofi yɛ Baba Nyameɛ ne y'Awurade Yesu Kristo berɛ ha ɛmɔ.<verse eid="2TH 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 1:3" />Aliemaa mɔ, ɛmɔ ti, odikyɛ daa yɛda Nyameɛ ase, ofikyɛ ɛmɔ gyidie yɛlɛ ala yeɛ ɔyɛ piri ɔ, na ɔdɔ bɔ ɛmɔle ye bɛma ɛmɔ nwo ne koso, ɔyɛ piri. <verse eid="2TH 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 1:4" />Ɛhe ati, yɛfa ɛmɔ yɛ hoahoa yɛ nwo wɔ Nyameɛ asafo ahoroɛ nemɔ nu, ofikyɛ ɔmva ye nwo kyɛ bɛtane ɛmɔ, na ɛmɔsa bɛnwu amaneɛ ne, ɛmɔfa animia begyina nu, na ɛmɔda gyidie ali.<verse eid="2TH 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 1:5" />Ɛhe te Nyameɛ atemmuo bɔ ɔtengyɛ nanwo adanzeɛ, na ɛhene ti, babu ɛmɔ kyɛ ɛmɔ fata Nyameɛ ahennie bɔ ɛmɔnwu ye nwo amaneɛ ne. <verse eid="2TH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 1:6" />Ofikyɛ, ɔtengyɛ wɔ Nyameɛ nye so kyɛ, bɛbɔ bɛmaa ɛmɔnwu amaneɛ ne, ɔkɔfa amanehunu kotua bɛ so kerɛ. <verse eid="2TH 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 1:7" />Nakoso, ɛmɔ bɔ ɛmɔnwu amaneɛ ne de, yɛ ne ɛmɔ mukoraati kole yɛ nwomeɛ, mmerɛ bɔ bala Awurade Yesu ali wɔ anwuro, bɔ ye abɔfo bɔ bɛle tumi ne boka ye so <verse eid="2TH 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 1:8" />wɔ see bɔ ɔsɔ buru-buru nu. Ná okotua bɛbɔ bɛnze Nyameɛ, ɔne bɛbɔ bɛndie y'Awurade Yesu nwo nzɛmba ne kerɛ ne. <verse eid="2TH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 1:9" />Sɔ mmenia nemɔ, ɔkɔsɛkye bɛ koraa kɔfa kɔhwe bɛ so, na ɔkɔye bɛ kofi Awurade nyunu, ne ye anuonyam tumi nanwo. <verse eid="2TH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 1:10" />Sɔ kyẽa ne, bɛkɔhyɛ ɔne ye akrongronfoɛ ne anuonyam, na ye nwo kɔyɛ bɛbɔ bɛlɛle ye bɛlili ne nwanwa, ofikyɛ adanzeɛ bɔ yɛlili ne, ɛmɔle bɛlili.<verse eid="2TH 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 1:11" />Yeti daa yɛbɔ mbaeɛ yɛma ɛmɔ, kyɛ yɛ Nyameɛ konwu ɛmɔ kyɛ ɛmɔ fata ye frɛlɛ ne, na wafa ye tumi ne wayɛ nikye pa biala bɔ ɔsɔ ye nye, ne gyidie adwuma biala, <verse eid="2TH 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 1:12" />kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a, bɛkɔhyɛ y'Awurade Yesu dumaa anuonyam wɔ ɛmɔ nu, na bahyɛ ɛmɔ anuonyam wɔ ye nu, kyɛbɔ yɛ Nyameɛ ne Awurade Yesu Kristo adom ne te ne.<verse eid="2TH 1:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2TH 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 2:1" />Afei aliemaa mɔ, mmerɛ bɔ y'Awurade Yesu Kristo kɔwa, ɔne mmerɛ bɔ bɛkɔboɔboa yɛ noa maa yɛkooyia ye ne de, yɛ srɛ ɛmɔ, <verse eid="2TH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 2:2" />sɛ ɛmɔte kyɛ bɛkeka kyɛ Awurade kyẽa ne awa, ná sɛ bɛka kyɛ ɔte honhom nu dwirɛ, anaa ebiemɔ yeɛ bɛka ɔ, anaa ngrataa bɔ ofi yɛ berɛ a, nnɛmaa ɛmɔ tia nu yɛ ɛmɔ kesenee, anaa ɛmɔ kunu tete ɛmɔ. <verse eid="2TH 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 2:3" />Nnɛmɔ maa ebiala laka-laka ɛmɔ wɔ atee biala so, ofikyɛ sɔ kyẽa ne ngɔwa, sana atuateɛ ne di moa ba, maa sona bɔ onni mmeraa so ne — baa bɔ wasɛkye ne nwo da berɛ kora. <verse eid="2TH 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 2:4" />Ye yeɛ ɔma ye nwo so na odwɔso tia nikye biala bɔ bɛfrɛ ye nyameɛ, anaa nikye biala bɔ bɛsõ ye ne. Yeti, ɔkɔtena Nyameɛ asɔre awuro berɛ, na ɔkɔmaa ebiala konwu ye kyɛ, ɔte nyameɛ. <verse eid="2TH 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 2:5" />Ɛmɔngaye kyɛ mmerɛ bɔ né nwɔ ɛmɔ berɛ ne, né metaa meka sɔ dwirɛ he mekyire ɛmɔ? <verse eid="2TH 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 2:6" />Ɛmɔ de, nnaa ɛmɔse bɔ wasi ye atee ne, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a, ye nwo kɔla berɛ wɔ ye mmerɛ nu ne. <verse eid="2TH 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 2:7" />Nahorɛ nu, bɔ onni mmeraa so ne nwo dwirɛ bɔ wafea ne ahyɛ yebo dada, nakoso, ɔkɔhɔ so kɔfea koodwu kyɛ, bɔ wasi y atee ne kofi berɛ ɔ. <verse eid="2TH 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 2:8" />Ɛhene si ne, bɔ onni mmeraa so ne bo kɔla so, ye yeɛ Awurade Yesu kɔfa ye noa nu honhom kɔye ye kofi berɛ wɔ ye walɛ nanu ne, na sɛ bɛda Awurade Yesu ali a, ɔkɔsɛkye ye koraa. <verse eid="2TH 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 2:9" />Satan yeɛ ɔkɔmaa bɔ onni mmeraa so ne kɔwa ɔ, na ɔkɔmaa ɔkɔyɛ nningyein bɔ ɔyɛ suro, anwanwadeɛ bɔ ɔtte nahorɛ, nzɛngyerɛneɛ ahoroɛ, <verse eid="2TH 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 2:10" />ne nnaka-nnaka bɔ ɔttemaye kɔfa kɔ laka-laka bɛbɔ bɛsɛkye ne. Ofikyɛ nahorɛ bɔ okole bɛ ngoa ne, bannya ɔdɔ bamma ye. <verse eid="2TH 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 2:11" />Yeti, Nyameɛ maa nnaka-nnaka nyane bɛ so tumi, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a, bɛkole ngondombo ne bɛkoli, <verse eid="2TH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 2:12" />na wamaa babu bɛ mukoraati atɛn, ofikyɛ banne nahorɛ ne banni, mmom né bɛ nye gye nningyein bɔ ɔndengyɛ nwo.<verse eid="2TH 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TH 2:13" />Nakoso, aliemaa mɔ bɔ Awurade dɔ ɛmɔ, ɛmɔ ti, odikyɛ daa yɛda Nyameɛ ase, ofikyɛ ahyɛaseɛ ne yeɛ Nyameɛ yele ɛmɔ kyɛ ɛmɔnya daa ngoa, nate ye honhom bɔ ɔfa tele ɛmɔ nwo, ɔne gyidie bɔ ɛmɔle ye wɔ nahorɛ nanu naso. <verse eid="2TH 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TH 2:14" />Ɔnate nzɛmba bɔ yɛka naso yeɛ ɔfrɛle ɛmɔ wale daa ngoa nanu ɔ, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a, ɛmɔ konya y'Awurade Yesu Kristo anuonyam ne. <verse eid="2TH 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TH 2:15" />Yeti aliemaa mɔ, ɛmɔgyina pindinn, na ɛmɔsɔ bɔ yɛhyirele ɛmɔ nanu yé, kyɛ ɔte edwirɛ bɔ yɛfale yɛ noa yɛ hane, anaa ngrataa bɔ yɛ hworɔle ne.<verse eid="2TH 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TH 2:16" />Afei, y'Awurade Kristo Yesu bɔbɔ ne yɛ Baba Nyameɛ bɔ ɔlɔle yɛ, na ye adom ti ɔmane yɛ awerɛkyekye bɔ ɔwɔ berɛ daa ne anidasoɛ pa ne, <verse eid="2TH 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TH 2:17" />ɔma ɛmɔ ahone tɔ ɛmɔ kunu, na ɛmɔyɛ se wɔ dwudwolɛ ne adwuma pa biala nu.<verse eid="2TH 2:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2TH 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 3:1" />Afei aliemaa mɔ, ɛmɔhɔ so bɛbɔ mbaeɛ bɛma yɛ, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a Awurade dwirɛ ne kɔtrɛ ndɛndɛ, na wanya anuonyam, kyɛbɔ wanya ye wɔ ɛmɔ dɔ ne. <verse eid="2TH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 3:2" />Afei ɛmɔsrɛ Nyameɛ, kyɛ ole yɛ fi amumuyɛfoɛ ne abɔnefoɛ sa nu, ofikyɛ nná ebiala yeɛ ole gyidie ɔ. <verse eid="2TH 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 3:3" />Nakoso, Awurade di nahorɛ, na ɔkɔmaa ɛmɔ kɔyɛ se na wabɔ ɛmɔ nwo waen wafi ɔbɔnefoɛ ne sa nu. <verse eid="2TH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 3:4" />Na yɛle ɛmɔ nu gyidie wɔ Awurade nu, kyɛ akwankyerɛ bɔ yɛfa yɛmane ɛmɔ ne, ɛmɔfa bɛyɛ adwuma, na ɛmɔ kɔhɔ so bɛkɔfa bɛkɔyɛ adwuma. <verse eid="2TH 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 3:5" />Yɛsrɛ Awurade kyɛ, ohyire ɛmɔ ahone atee hɔ Nyameɛ dɔ nwo, na Kristo ti, ɛmɔmia ɛmɔ nye.<verse eid="2TH 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 3:6" />Afei aliemaa mɔ, yɛ ma ɛmɔ akwankyerɛ wɔ Awurade Kristo Yesu dumaa nu kyɛ, aliemaa biala bɔ ɔnate basabasa, na ɔmva edwirɛ bɔ yɛha yɛ hyirele ɛmɔ<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Ye.”</char></note> ne nnyɛ adwuma ne, ɛmɔhwe ɛmɔ nwo bɛfi ye nwo. <verse eid="2TH 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 3:7" />Ná ɛmɔ bɔbɔ ɛmɔse kyɛ, odikyɛ ɛmɔsuesua yɛ, ofikyɛ yannyɛ basabasa wɔ ɛmɔ nu, <verse eid="2TH 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 3:8" />na yanni ebiala aleɛ mbaen.<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Yanni ebiala aleɛ bɔ yandua ye kerɛ ɔ.”</char></note> Mmom yɛ yerele yɛ nwo yɛ yɛle adwuma eyia ne kɔngɔen, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a, yɛngɔfa adesoa biala yɛngɔto ɛmɔ so ɔ. <verse eid="2TH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 3:9" />Né yɛle tumi kyɛ yedɛ nningyein yefi ɛmɔ berɛ, nakoso né yɛpena kyɛ yɛyɛ nikye bie maa ɛmɔ suesua. <verse eid="2TH 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 3:10" />Nahorɛ dwirɛ yeɛ ole kyɛ, mmerɛ bɔ ne yɛwɔ ɛmɔ berɛ ne, né yɛtaa yɛma ɛmɔ ahyɛdeɛ kyɛ: “Sona biala bɔ onguro kyɛ ɔyɛ adwuma a, nnɛmaa odidi.” <verse eid="2TH 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 3:11" />Yate kyɛ ebiemɔ nate basabasa wɔ ɛmɔ nu bɔ bɛnyɛ adwuma koraa, na bɛfa bɛ nwo bɛdide amanvoɛ dwirɛ nu. <verse eid="2TH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 3:12" />Sɔ mmenia ne, yɛhyɛ bɛ, na yɛtu bɛ fo wɔ Awurade Yesu Kristo nu kyɛ, bɛyɛ konn, na bɛyɛ adwuma bɛpena bɛ noa aleɛ. <verse eid="2TH 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TH 3:13" />Aliemaa mɔ, ɛmɔ de, nnɛmɔ yakyi pa bɔ ɛmɔyɛ ne.<verse eid="2TH 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TH 3:14" />Nakoso, sɛ ebie andie edwirɛ bɔ ɔwɔ krataa he anu ne a, ɛmɔhyɛ sɔ sona ne nzorɛ, na ɛmɔhwe ɛmɔ nwo bɛfi ye nwo, ná wamaa wafɛle. <verse eid="2TH 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TH 3:15" />Nakoso, Nnɛmɔbu ye kyɛ ɔte ɛmɔ tamfo, mmom, ɛmɔtu ye fo kyɛ aliemaa.<verse eid="2TH 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TH 3:16" />Yɛsrɛ asomdwie Wura ne kyɛ, ye bɔbɔ ɔma ɛmɔ asomdwie daa wɔ atee biala so. Awurade ne ɛmɔ mukoraati tena.<verse eid="2TH 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TH 3:17" />Paul, me ngyeaa bɔ mafa me bɔbɔ me sa mahworɔ ɛhe. Ɛhe yeɛ mefa mehyɛ me ngrataa mukoraati nzorɛ ɔ, sɔa yeɛ metworɔ ɔ.<verse eid="2TH 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TH 3:18" />Y'Awurade Yesu Kristo Adom ha ɛmɔ mukoraati.<verse eid="2TH 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 3" />
</usx>